      <itunes:duration>20:00</itunes:duration>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Clickbait Title</title>
      <description>In this episode, Alex and Jamie explore the dual nature of AI, highlighting both its potential to revolutionize industries like healthcare and its darker implications, such as privacy erosion and workforce displacement. They discuss the ethical balance necessary to navigate AI's rapid advancements, emphasizing the importance of cautious optimism and regulation.</description>
